          {
            "title": "One Indent",
            "id": 84801,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonların kod blokları olduğunu biliyoruz. Bu, iç içe talimatların süslü parantezlerle çevrelendiği ve sol tarafta fazladan boşluk bulunduğu anlamına gelir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>console.log(message);</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyonların birer kod bloğu olduğunu biliyoruz. Yani iç içe talimatlar süslü parantezlerle çevrelenir ve sol taraflarında fazladan boşluk bulunur. Fonksiyonu, çağrıldığında <code>Approved</code> görüntüleyecek şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"message\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;message&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(message)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Denied\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>message</code>, <code>displayMessage</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Approved\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Braces and spaces",
            "id": 84797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun içine başka kod blokları ekleyebiliriz. Bunu yaptığımızda, eklenen küme parantezi çifti hangi talimatların nereye ait olduğunu anlamamızı sağlar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>{</code>, ardından <code>{</code> ve sonra <code>}</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun içine başka kod blokları ekleyebiliriz. Bunu yaptığımızda, ek süslü parantez çifti hangi talimatların nereye ait olduğunu gösterir. İç içe kontrolü, <code>26</code> yaşındaki kiracı onaylanacak şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isRenting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>age</code>, ardından <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>21</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>isRentingAge</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Indenting the entire block",
            "id": 84800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Soldaki boşluğa <strong>girinti</strong> denir. Bir kod bloğunu başka bir kod bloğunun içine eklediğimizde, kod bloğunun tamamı bir boşluk girintilenir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAlarm\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (time === \" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Waky waky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayAlarm(\" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Waky waky\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>if (time === \"7:00\") {</code>, ardından <code>console.log(\"Waky waky\");</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Soldaki boşluğa <strong>girinti</strong> denir. Bir kod bloğunu başka bir bloğun içine eklediğimizde bloğun tamamı bir boşluk girintilenir. İç içe bloğu, eşleşen saat <code>Waky waky</code> görüntüleyecek şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayAlarm\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"time\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (time === \" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Waky waky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayAlarm(\" /><text value=\"&quot;7:00&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;8:00&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(time);\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Waky waky\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>time</code>, ardından <code>===</code>, <code>console.log(\"Waky waky\");</code> ve son olarak <code>\"7:00\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Code blocks",
            "id": 84796,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadelerini fonksiyonların içine yerleştirmek, kodumuzu düzenlememize ve yeniden kullanmamıza yardımcı olur. Artık aynı <code>if</code> ifadesini bir fonksiyon çağrısıyla kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>isRentingAge</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>26</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> ifadelerini fonksiyonların içine yerleştirmek kodumuzu düzenlememize ve yeniden kullanmamıza yardımcı olur. Artık aynı <code>if</code> ifadesini bir fonksiyon çağrısıyla kullanabiliriz. Fonksiyonu <code>Approved</code> görüntülemesini sağlayacak bir yaşla çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isRenting\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Approved\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>age</code>, ardından <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>21</code>, <code>isRentingAge</code> ve son olarak <code>26</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
