            "title": "Question: Braces and spaces",
            "id": 85824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyonun <code>if</code> deyiminin dışında kaç talimatı var?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check done\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir görüntüleme ifadesi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbiri; tüm talimatlar <code>if</code> deyiminin parçasıdır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir görüntüleme ifadesi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu fonksiyon <code>15</code> ile çağrıldığında hangi satır görüntülenir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isRentingAge\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (age &gt;= \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Approved&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Check done&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"isRentingAge(\" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Check done\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yalnızca <code>Check done</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yalnızca <code>Approved</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Approved</code>, ardından <code>Check done</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yalnızca <code>Check done</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
